 🚨 U.S.-based blockchain intelligence firm TRM said a North Korean hacking unit was likely behind the theft of $6.3 billion from the world's biggest cryptocurrency exchange, Binance. The hack is the "largest bank heist in human history," said Ari Redbord, TRM's global head of policy. Get the latest . 

 
 
